  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1548972222}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 130684004}
  dialogue:
  - Listen, I dont know you but please leave!
  - 
  - Quest1
  - Quest1
  - Quest1
  - Quest1
  - Quest1
  - Please dont kill us...
  - Oh... That is embarrasing
  - Mayor Slim sent you to help? No offense but who are you?
  - I see... well that is a mighty fine sword you have, and none of us in Townington
    are much for fighting...
  - Which is how we ended up in this prediciment in the first place.
  - Our town has been over run by creatures. if you are willing to take them out...
  - ...we can get down to business as usual.
  - Well? Are the creatures cleared out yet???
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Thank you so much! we will get back to work right away, just need some shipments
    from the farm!
  - If you are heading that way, could you let the farmers know we are ready for
    the next shipment!
  - They are just 2 plots East!
  - 
