  dialogueText: {fileID: 130684004}
  dialogue:
  - Hello there traveler!
  - If you want to discuss entering our trading route, I suggest you talk to the
    mayor just up the road here.
  - After that you should go to the Shop at the south of our town, upgrade some tools!
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Seems like youre heading to Townington, I wish you luck!
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Hope the Townington situation isnt too tough for ya
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Heard what you did for those Townies, Good on you
  - 
