  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 52d82f04c85b5c64698a31f0d9e9d081, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1548972222}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 130684004}
  dialogue:
  - Hey There! Names Slim. What can I do you for?
  - I see... You wish to add your village to the trading route.
  - Unfortunately things are in a tough place right now. I'm sure you saw on your
    way in,
  - creatures have taken over a lot of this land... Not sure why or how to drive
    them away.
  - Along with that, Townington has stopped delivering their fair share of the prepared
    crops.
  - If you really want to get on this route, Id check in with them and see if you
    can help out in any way.
  - They are 2 plots west and 2 plots north. Cant miss them!
  - Have you gone to Townington yet? they are 2 plots West and 2 Plots North!
  - 
  - Quest2
  - Quest2
  - Quest2
  - Quest2
  - Quest2
  - Heard you met the Townies, weak with a sword but great with food.
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Nice job with those Townies, you should let those farmers know theyll be ready
    for trades!
  - 
